  "prefLabel": "Rev 707.05 Refusal to Pay Tax",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 707.05 Refusal to Pay Tax. If any person liable for tax imposed by RSA 78-A refuses to pay upon request, the operator shall promptly notify the department in writing that such an offense has occurred.\n\nSource. #10714, eff 11-7-14 (from Rev 705.05); ss by #14105, eff 10-29-24, EXPIRES: 10-29-34",
